s here.\n\nThe test case is extremely slow in debug builds so I didn't add it. I confirmed\nthat it no longer reproduces with the patch.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334058\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337187\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/AtomMarking-inl.h", "js/src/jit-test/tests/gc/bug-2082083.js"], "git_node": "fdaee22c56c60dc153dfcdef0e9d14209c2c1836", "git_parents": ["2aceec957ee13a04ab79a9d13c1090d16ff9c1d7"], "node": "b592dd94f89f1aa909f55650e1026088a380bed8", "parents": ["8850f72ae0647055d644f420412cdbe02ca26a4f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793127119, "git_changesets": ["fdaee22c56c60dc153dfcdef0e9d14209c2c1836"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1125": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081994 - Report all weakmap entries via TraceWeakMaps API (ESR153)  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nCurrently this skips entries where the value is not a GC thing.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337193\n", "files": ["js/public/friend/CycleCollector.h", "js/src/builtin/WeakSetObject.cpp", "js/src/builtin/WeakSetObject.h", "js/src/gc/WeakMap-inl.h", "js/src/jsapi-tests/testWeakMap.cpp", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSRuntime.cpp"], "git_node": "946089fa9111e70fd999a70621c25c61c9205935", "git_parents": ["fdaee22c56c60dc153dfcdef0e9d14209c2c1836"], "node": "7b990d701567946dacc3cfecfd16af01389aeb1c", "parents": ["b592dd94f89f1aa909f55650e1026088a380bed8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793127143, "git_changesets": ["946089fa9111e70fd999a70621c25c61c9205935"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1126": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079466 - Tell the cycle collector about Symbols reachable through PropMaps (ESR153)  a=dmeehan\n\nThe TODO comment correctly pointed out that this was missing although it\nunderestimated its importance.\n\nDifferentia