0b94740a84c357e93346ec4f4c94521e3\n", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": "00f7a516466c5b0e4c868efe14aeb12462c3219b", "git_parents": ["b8552c9cefd89f35798cd8674de343e02cf81fea"], "node": "cdd1deb1eaee06cb8fd86d0ae7fad7cf02aad925", "parents": ["45f4df4adfe6d7c7578e56181fb5538b75e8889f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793560022, "git_changesets": ["b8552c9cefd89f35798cd8674de343e02cf81fea", "00f7a516466c5b0e4c868efe14aeb12462c3219b"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "1178": {"changesets": [{"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086767 - Save the directory instead of the file as the last temporary add-on location in about:debugging;  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338013\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338730\n", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging/src/modules/extensions-helper.js", "devtools/client/aboutdebugging/test/browser/browser_aboutdebugging_addons_temporary_install_path.js"], "git_node": "2b24bc6164958e6111f7f8fbc807c1e924bab153", "git_parents": ["00f7a516466c5b0e4c868efe14aeb12462c3219b"], "node": "91789211a20f7ddf0a5a1a43e4599b0cd3b95ea5", "parents": ["cdd1deb1eaee06cb8fd86d0ae7fad7cf02aad925"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793639169, "git_changesets": ["2b24bc6164958e6111f7f8fbc807c1e924bab153"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1179": {"changesets": [{"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082075 - Make `SelectionMovementUtils::PeekOffsetForCaretMove` adjust the result of `GetPrimaryFrameForCaret` outside generated content  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\n`SelectionMovementUtils::GetPrimaryFrameForCaret` may dive into\ngenerate content nodes because its callers may require generated text\naround the selection to show caret or some other UI. However,\n`SelectionMovementUtils::PeekOffsetForCaretMove` shouldn't return\ngenerated content nodes because the result may be used for new selection\nrange boundary. Therefore, after calling `GetPrimaryFrameForCaret`, it\nneeds to ensure the point is outside any generated content and peeks\noffset from there.\n\nNote that the new code does not handle the position in\n`TreeKind::FlatForSelection` intentionally because\n`nsFrameSelection::MoveCaret` which is the primary caller of\n`SelectionMovementUtils::PeekOffsetForCaretMove` handles `TreeKind::DOM`\ntree.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336965\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338627\n", "files": ["layout/generic/SelectionMovementUtils.cpp", "layout/generic/SelectionMovementUtils.h", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.h"], "git_node": "aafcfb9e28da3fba0c3c082b43a5e154ffceaa0d", "git_parents": ["2b24bc6164958e6111f7f8fbc807c1e924bab153"], "node": "a257bfb1f84951a299ee773d0bbb15b771388b93", "parents": ["91789211a20f7ddf0a5a1a43e4599b0cd3b95ea5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793639190, "git_changesets": ["aafcfb9e28da3fba0c3c082b43a5e154ffceaa0d"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1180": {"changesets": [{"author": "Harveer Singh \u003chsingh@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082109 - Hold a strong reference to SessionStorageManager in Observe.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338121\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338743\n", "files": ["dom/storage/SessionStorageManager.cpp"], "git_node": "3755b0a82c386663cb8b6e811a3252f23a54eab8", "git_parents": ["aafcfb9e28da3fba0c3c082b43a5e154ffceaa0d"], "node": "6fe3e0a3437276e1a2ead26172fa2d0d0bd84034", "parents": ["a257bfb1f84951a299ee773d0bbb15b771388b93"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793639210, "git_changesets": ["3755b0a82c386663cb8b6e811a3252f23a54eab8"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1181": {"changesets": [{"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@intuitionlibrary.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2086296 - Keep destroyed actors queued with deferred destroy commands in offscreen WebRender transactions.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338178\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338634\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/wr/WebRenderBridgeChild.cpp"], "git_node": "2cc4540724d4aa550c7472bf10fd6d03953b0d99", "git_parents": ["3755b0a82c386663cb8b6e811a3252f23a54eab8"], "node": "84872712045bbc0fc3e63f92ebf5d793d671e6ab", "parents": ["6fe3e0a3437276e1a2ead26172fa2d0d0bd84034"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793639230, "git_changesets": ["2cc4540724d4aa550c7472bf10fd6d03953b0d99"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1182": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079689 - Ensure WeakRef targets are added to the CC graph  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nWe already clear WeakRef targets for GC things that are white in the CC graph,\nbut not all GC things are represented in the CC graph and if the node is\nmissing then this check will fail. There are several reasons for GC things to\nbe missing: they might be garbage or they just might not have been considered\nby the CC.\n\nThe patch ensures WeakRef targets are present in the CC graph at the start so\nwe can get an accurate result. Only objects are added. Symbols must be used as\nWeakMap keys to be part of a gray cycle and these keys are already added to the\nCC graph.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337944\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338792\n", "files": ["js/public/friend/CycleCollector.h", "js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.cpp", "js/src/gc/FinalizationObservers.h", "js/src/gc/GCRuntime.h", "xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSRuntime.cpp"], "git_node": "0b65c89f0746c4c798931d5be48591df00d208ab", "git_parents": ["2cc4540724d4aa550c7472bf10fd6d03953b0d99"], "node": "030db57c77e52b8ee8012a320608f298b7b163af", "parents": ["84872712045bbc0fc3e63f92ebf5d793d671e6ab"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793639251, "git_changesets": ["0b65c89f0746c4c798931d5be48591df00d208ab"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1183": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr153 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes ct-logs  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338643\n", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/newtab-wallpapers-v2.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/onecrl.json"], "git_node": "01518d0b9a07c7836e82991e8b7f50fe2906fff4", "git_parents": ["0b65c89f0746c4c798931d5be48591df00d208ab"], "node": "50d03b9b386c9da99c21ee413c64ea212b0ba3f4", "parents": ["030db57c77e52b8ee8012a320608f298b7b163af"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793639429, "git_changesets": ["01518d0b9a07c7836e82991e8b7f50fe2906fff4"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1184": {"changesets": [{"author": "John M. Schanck \u003cjschanck@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2088179 - upgrade NSS to NSS_3_125_1_RTM.  UPGRADE_NSS_RELEASE  a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338871\n", "files": ["security/certverifier/ExtendedValidation.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/RootHashes.inc", "security/manager/tools/KnownRootHashes.txt", "security/manager/tools/cert_validation_by_ca_query.sql", "security/nss/TAG-INFO", "security/nss/gtests/pk11_gtest/pk11_hmac_unittest.cc", "security/nss/gtests/pk11_gtest/pk11_pbe_unittest.cc", "security/nss/lib/ckfw/builtins/certdata.txt", "security/nss/lib/ckfw/builtins/nssckbi.h", "security/nss/lib/ckfw/builtins/nssckbi.rc", "security/nss/lib/nss/nss.h", "security/nss/lib/pk11wrap/pk11mech.c", "security/nss/lib/pk11wrap/pk11pbe.c", "security/nss/lib/softoken/lowpbe.c", "security/nss/lib/softoken/pkcs11c.c", "security/nss/lib/softoken/sftkhmac.c", "security/nss/lib/softoken/softkver.h", "security/nss/lib/ssl/dtlscon.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/sslencode.c", "security/nss/lib/ssl/sslimpl.h", "security/nss/lib/ssl/sslnonce.c", "security/nss/lib/util/nssutil.h", "security/nss/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "2c6c55020b445e7519e6d4a3b046b3d1ef807e44", "git_parents": ["01518d0b9a07c7836e82991e8b7f50fe2906fff4"], "node": "14100c0fb2c7f16ad530139a749fe7c13b8c92ce", "parents": ["50d03b9b386c9da99c21ee413c64ea212b0ba3f4"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793650460, "git_changesets": ["2c6c55020b445e7519e6d4a3b046b3d1ef807e44"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1185": {"changesets": [{"author": "Matthew Gaudet \u003cmgaudet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083154 - Resolve legacy POSIX time zones before ICU calculations and formatting.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334747\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339162\n", "files": ["intl/components/gtest/TestLegacyPOSIXTimeZone.cpp", "intl/components/gtest/moz.build", "intl/components/src/Calendar.cpp", "intl/components/src/DateIntervalFormat.cpp", "intl/components/src/DateTimeFormat.cpp", "intl/components/src/TimeZone.cpp", "intl/components/src/TimeZone.h", "js/src/tests/non262/Date/realm-time-zone-legacy-posix.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Date/time-zones-legacy-posix.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_legacy_posix.js", "js/src/vm/DateTime.cpp"], "git_node": "04353a7ebd163bf04f7bdcb90a840371e0e58369", "git_parents": ["2c6c55020b445e7519e6d4a3b046b3d1ef807e44"], "node": "c03fcbad8abbb43454ed1a7e7bec7fe3b8169e6d", "parents": ["14100c0fb2c7f16ad530139a749fe7c13b8c92ce"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715066, "git_changesets": ["04353a7ebd163bf04f7bdcb90a840371e0e58369"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1186": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082451 - Add guarded-by annotation to mPlatformFontEntry.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338812\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D339069\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxFontEntry.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxTextRun.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.h", "layout/style/FontFaceSetDocumentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "adbdc0452ce6b85730b56fa29eadc22b7216a9fe", "git_parents": ["04353a7ebd163bf04f7bdcb90a840371e0e58369"], "node": "a3711fc78e5484b4ddfc78e00d345354fac8c28d", "parents": ["c03fcbad8abbb43454ed1a7e7bec7fe3b8169e6d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715102, "git_changesets": ["adbdc0452ce6b85730b56fa29eadc22b7216a9fe"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1187": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Shin \u003cdshin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2087354: For :has, try to detect change in the potentially-changed compound.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nInitially, this was not implemented because the tradeoff seemed minor/negative\nand we focused on minimizing upwards traversals by marking :has search paths.\nOne way or the other, that doesn't seem enough.\n\n... Only single element property mutations have snapshots, so DOM mutations\nremain unchanged (... It's unlikely that this approach is correct for DOM\nmutations, anyway). That side could use an improvement as well, tracked in\nBug 2086739.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338425\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338954\n", "files": ["servo/components/selectors/matching.rs", "servo/components/style/invalidation/element/relative_selector.rs", "servo/ports/geckolib/glue.rs"], "git_node": "017190122f66cb5c0b4219997134ca3afab098f6", "git_parents": ["adbdc0452ce6b85730b56fa29eadc22b7216a9fe"], "node": "00ac0eac79998c0afe3af3596fa8bced37202fb3", "parents": ["a3711fc78e5484b4ddfc78e00d345354fac8c28d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715122, "git_changesets": ["017190122f66cb5c0b4219997134ca3afab098f6"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1188": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2083626:  gate the optimized jar layout behind an explicit opt-in  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nBuildFileList's offset-4 \"optimized jar layout\" shortcut (bug 559961) was\ngated only on XRE_IsParentProcess(), not on whether the file is actually\nour own omni.jar.\n\nAdd aAllowOptimizedLayout to nsZipArchive::OpenArchive, defaulting to\nfalse, and have Omnijar pass true, since it already knows the file is our\nown omni.jar. Every other caller now always uses the standard EOCD-based\nparse.\n\nAlso updates test_corrupt_1801102.js: its fixture happens to have a\nCentral Directory signature at offset 4, so it's now rejected at open()\ninstead of later during test().\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335617\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338768\n", "files": ["modules/libjar/nsZipArchive.cpp", "modules/libjar/nsZipArchive.h", "modules/libjar/test/unit/test_corrupt_1801102.js", "xpcom/build/Omnijar.cpp"], "git_node": "06be7a21d7f7c47757edb8a63e598be7e07180c6", "git_parents": ["017190122f66cb5c0b4219997134ca3afab098f6"], "node": "521310ffbdd8d5373aaaac10213d4666c8be008a", "parents": ["00ac0eac79998c0afe3af3596fa8bced37202fb3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715144, "git_changesets": ["06be7a21d7f7c47757edb8a63e598be7e07180c6"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1189": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082101 - Refuse off-thread promise task registration after async task shutdown  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334345\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338805\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/AtomicsObject.cpp", "js/src/vm/OffThreadPromiseRuntimeState.cpp"], "git_node": "81f42be88e947da4b023bd69c0be183ace005192", "git_parents": ["06be7a21d7f7c47757edb8a63e598be7e07180c6"], "node": "550a25880ddb2f159e4097e57190444b9c2bb79e", "parents": ["521310ffbdd8d5373aaaac10213d4666c8be008a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082101 - Don't resolve CookieStore and getNotifications() promises in a dying global  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334346\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D338806\n", "files": ["dom/cookiestore/CookieStore.cpp", "dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreManager.cpp", "dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorkerRegistration.cpp"], "git_node": "ae59ec9a157968c28734dc2ffc7879adb99dea4b", "git_parents": ["81f42be88e947da4b023bd69c0be183ace005192"], "node": "b48d0c9ecacf48f1cf4a392d56a314a6bc2408df", "parents": ["550a25880ddb2f159e4097e57190444b9c2bb79e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1793715421, "git_changesets": ["81f42be88e947da4b023bd69c0be183ace005192", "ae59ec9a157968c28734dc2ffc7879adb99dea4b"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1190": {"changesets": [{"author": "DonalMe \u003c76789979+DonalMe@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 20824510 - ESR153 build fix a=bustage\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.cpp"], "git_node": "9aecd40e03ebf6e866e32a0a3001488ed751228d", "git_parents": ["ae59ec9a157968c28734dc2ffc7879adb99dea4b"], "node": "a9effd9e521653405f0ffd311e8edf90bde92237", "parents": ["b48d0c9ecacf48f1cf4a392d56a314a6bc2408df"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_153_7_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_153_7_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1793719152, "git_changesets": ["9aecd40e03ebf6e866e32a0a3001488ed751228d"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}}
